        "variation": "statement (p1) - displaced +2 rows and re-harmonised over Am/C (p2) - transposed up a step as a sequence (p3) - inverted and a fourth higher over the borrowed Eb (p4) - final thinned statement over the chromatic bass (p9)"
      },
      "bank": {
        "instruments": [
          "lead-thin",
          "pluck",
